### Sample requests — run from IntelliJ's HTTP client or VS Code REST Client.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### List products (JSON is the default)
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=0&size=10

### Same list as XML — selected by the Accept header
GET {{host}}/api/products
Accept: application/xml

### ...or by query parameter
GET {{host}}/api/products/KB-100?format=xml

### Price in another currency (calls the external exchange-rate API)
GET {{host}}/api/products/KB-100/price?currency=USD

### Create a product with an XML body (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Basic admin admin-secret
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<product>
  <sku>HS-500</sku>
  <name>Wireless Headset</name>
  <category>audio</category>
  <price>59.00</price>
  <stock>30</stock>
</product>

### Validation error -> RFC 9457 problem details listing every invalid field
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Basic admin admin-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "bad sku", "price": -1}

### Bulk import a supplier XML feed (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/products/import
Authorization: Basic admin admin-secret
Content-Type: application/xml

<catalogFeed supplier="ACME" generatedAt="2026-11-25T08:00:00Z">
  <item sku="KB-100">
    <name>Mechanical Keyboard</name>
    <category>peripherals</category>
    <price>84.90</price>
    <stock>60</stock>
  </item>
  <item sku="CM-900">
    <name>4K Webcam</name>
    <category>video</category>
    <price>119.00</price>
    <stock>12</stock>
  </item>
</catalogFeed>

### Place an order in XML (partner)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Basic partner partner-secret
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<order>
  <customerReference>ACME-42</customerReference>
  <lines>
    <line><sku>KB-100</sku><quantity>2</quantity></line>
    <line><sku>MN-270</sku><quantity>1</quantity></line>
  </lines>
</order>

### Place an order in JSON that cannot be fulfilled -> 422 with violations
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Basic partner partner-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerReference": "ACME-42", "lines": [{"sku": "MN-270", "quantity": 999}, {"sku": "NOPE", "quantity": 1}]}

### List a customer's orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders?customerReference=ACME-42
Authorization: Basic partner partner-secret

### Ship an order (admin only)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Basic admin admin-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "SHIPPED"}
